# TodoMVC's own words, standing in for the spec's locators and helpers. The spec's
# createDefaultTodos isn't one: each Background adds its todos itself, since the
# scenarios name them.

Define: New-todo
  the Placeholder "What needs to be done?"

Define: Add Text (Name)
  Fill the New-todo with Name
  Press "Enter" on the New-todo

# A list item has no accessible name, so this finds nothing yet: see todo.md.
Define: Todo Text (Name)
  the Listitem Containing Name

Define: Tick Todo
  Check the Checkbox "Toggle Todo" Within Todo

Define: Untick Todo
  Uncheck the Checkbox "Toggle Todo" Within Todo

Define: Toggle-all
  the Field "Mark all as complete"

# Only the todo being edited shows its textbox.
Define: Editor
  the Textbox "Edit"
